00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:35.640
- He was like, "You weren't
supposed to go back...."

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:36.870
I wasn't supposed to go in the....

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:39.360
No one told me I wasn't
supposed to go in the backyard.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.950
What is going on?

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:42.840
Why do we want, you know?

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:44.520
So I just had to hmm,

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.328
