00:02:13.428 --> 00:02:14.551
- I'm too frugal.

00:02:14.551 --> 00:02:15.384
- Oh.

00:02:15.384 --> 00:02:16.217
(Angela laughs)

00:02:16.217 --> 00:02:17.876
