00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:28.110
(both laugh)
(audience laughing)

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:29.220
- That's amazing.

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:30.570
And you've lasted 25 years.

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:31.403
You're still doing it.
(Angela laughs)

00:02:31.403 --> 00:02:32.236
That's amazing.

00:02:32.236 --> 00:02:33.120
All right.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:34.920
The emergencies on
"911" get very creative.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.720
So how is season six going?

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:38.040
