00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:29.460
a couple of days before

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:33.180
reading through and rehearsals and stuff.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.020
It was planned.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:36.000
The producers and director had planned,

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.260
had rented a plane

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:40.050
and we all flew to South Carolina

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:43.456
and we went to visit
together his resting place.

00:07:43.456 --> 00:07:44.760
- Wow.
- Together.

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:47.340
And it was a beautiful day.

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:49.620
His uncles were there.
- Wow.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:50.790
- His cousin.

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:54.390
And we just spoke from our heart about him

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:55.680
how we felt about him
- Yeah.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:08:00.120
- or times with him and that
was really, really lovely.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:01.950
A great way to just begin

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:04.410
because we miss him terribly.
- Yeah.

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:06.240
Then when we got to the set,

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:07.073
it was like,

00:08:07.073 --> 00:08:09.420
okay we've had this
moment of coming together

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.940
and now we've got to come to work.

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:13.590
And that's what he would want for us.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:14.457
- I know.

00:08:14.457 --> 00:08:15.290
It's so funny.

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:16.123
It feels like the movie.

00:08:16.123 --> 00:08:17.100
It feels like that's something
you would've done in Wakanda

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:17.933
like if someone passed.

00:08:17.933 --> 00:08:18.766
You know what I'm saying?

00:08:18.766 --> 00:08:19.833
Like that feels,

00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:20.666
it feels . . . .

00:08:20.666 --> 00:08:21.499
I'm such a fan sorry.

00:08:21.499 --> 00:08:22.470
Keeping my cool.

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:24.492
I'm like really excited
about the new movie.

00:08:24.492 --> 00:08:27.300
